  <content>
  <section><para>Brooke was racing bikes with a friend on the way to the park. A table of her distance traveled over time is shown.</para>
<table class="os-raise-midsizetable">
  <tgroup cols="2"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>Time (minutes)</emphasis></entry><entry><emphasis>Distance (miles)</emphasis></entry></row>
  <row>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
      <entry>
        0
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        1.2
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        10
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2.4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        15
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3.6
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        20
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4.8
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>
        25
      </entry>
      <entry>
        6.0
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody></tgroup><caption>Brooke</caption>
  </table>

<para>What was Brooke’s average rate of change between 5 minutes and 20 minutes? </para></section>
</content>
